<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44024" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθύ̆βολ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλλω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throwing straight</i>: hence, <i>hitting the mark,
				accurate, exact</i>, prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθύβουλος</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Aristox.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.7.18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόκρισις, στοχασμοί</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.617
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.126
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα εὐ</span>. the
			<i>exact</i> name, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.73
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), al.: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.618
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.300
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὐ</span>., =
			foreg., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.465
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.99
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.872
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>: in the lit. sense, <i>in a direct course</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. περαιωθῆναι τὸ πέλαγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					5.22
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
